{"5009740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "METEORITE", "steam_appid": 5009740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIRST EVER PLANETARY SHOOTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In METEORITE, an entire   planet is your playground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in a meteor hurling towards it. There is no conventional shrinking circle and no invisible wall telling you where to go.  If you see a mountain, you can climb it. The battle is shaped by the terrain, the players, and the planetary systems waiting to be activated. The planet is different each time, so you can never be sure what to expect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your gear carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A LIVING ECOSYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross forests, deserts, frozen poles, mountains, canyons, bogs and abandoned ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search wreckage and ruins for weapons, equipment and rare artifacts. Hunt alien creatures. Track rival players across the landscape.... or avoid them until you are prepared to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is an unpredictable ecosystem that can turn against everyone on it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONIZE THE CLIMATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four climate stations are scattered throughout the planet. Destabilize one and an entire region becomes inhospitable, forcing players to relocate. Activate all four, and the battleground moves to the final circle protected by a shield bubble. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNFAIR BY DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract weapons, tools  and exotic alien technology. Everything you extract becomes your load-out in the next match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a diverse array of various weapons ranging from laser rifles, to alien rayguns... and repurposed mining equipment?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE OR CONQUER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave while you still possess something worth extracting, or remain on the planet and risk everything for control of the world itself. Successful expeditions expand your arsenal. Conquered planets become trophies of your victories and resources for the battles ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer extraction combat across spherical planetary battlegrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat enabled by default for maximum chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated terrain, biomes, ruins and encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbital deployment with freedom to choose your landing point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No conventional shrinking circle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-activated storms and world-altering events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firearms, energy weapons, alien technology and mobility equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile wildlife and environmental threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent equipment and planetary progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized science-fiction world built for exploration, improvisation and betrayal</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIRST EVER PLANETARY SHOOTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In METEORITE, an entire   planet is your playground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in a meteor hurling towards it. There is no conventional shrinking circle and no invisible wall telling you where to go.  If you see a mountain, you can climb it. The battle is shaped by the terrain, the players, and the planetary systems waiting to be activated. The planet is different each time, so you can never be sure what to expect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your gear carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A LIVING ECOSYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross forests, deserts, frozen poles, mountains, canyons, bogs and abandoned ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search wreckage and ruins for weapons, equipment and rare artifacts. Hunt alien creatures. Track rival players across the landscape.... or avoid them until you are prepared to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is an unpredictable ecosystem that can turn against everyone on it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONIZE THE CLIMATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four climate stations are scattered throughout the planet. Destabilize one and an entire region becomes inhospitable, forcing players to relocate. Activate all four, and the battleground moves to the final circle protected by a shield bubble. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNFAIR BY DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract weapons, tools  and exotic alien technology. Everything you extract becomes your load-out in the next match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a diverse array of various weapons ranging from laser rifles, to alien rayguns... and repurposed mining equipment?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE OR CONQUER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave while you still possess something worth extracting, or remain on the planet and risk everything for control of the world itself. Successful expeditions expand your arsenal. Conquered planets become trophies of your victories and resources for the battles ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer extraction combat across spherical planetary battlegrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat enabled by default for maximum chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated terrain, biomes, ruins and encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbital deployment with freedom to choose your landing point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No conventional shrinking circle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-activated storms and world-altering events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firearms, energy weapons, alien technology and mobility equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile wildlife and environmental threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent equipment and planetary progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized science-fiction world built for exploration, improvisation and betrayal</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "short_description": "A sandbox Battle Royale where you compete with 100 other lifeforms over a planet. Fight, scavenge, and explore procedurally-generated, destructible planets.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009740/3c3e81abcc320eb40510c6c222656d354e39de12/header.jpg?t=1787765448", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009740/f43bee2a5becf42d683dbd6dd0bbbe08fd2291b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787765448", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5009740/f43bee2a5becf42d683dbd6dd0bbbe08fd2291b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787765448", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-10400 / Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 Super / RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060 Ti/RTX 4060 8 GB / Radeon RX 6700 XT <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB a